                "text": "The Republican plan means higher costs and less coverage. It's time to return to Washington, protect your health care, and end this shutdown.\n\nEl plan republicano significa mayores gastos y menor cobertura. Es hora de regresar a Washington, proteger tu cuidado m\u00e9dico y terminar este cierre gubernamental.",
