                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thousands of families in our district will see their health care premiums soar under the current Republican plan. It\u2019s time to head back to Washington, reopen the government, and protect working families\u2019 health care. Let\u2019s get it done.",
