                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined my delegation colleagues calling on urgent action to protect SNAP benefits for New Jerseyans who depend on this program. Costs are going up and now working families are being squeezed by higher health care premiums. When will it be enough for this administration?",
